CREATED:20260225T135311Z
DESCRIPTION:Title of Presentation:\n"Innovations and Leadership in Surgica
 l Education"\n\nSpeaker:\nRanjan Sudan\, MD\, FACS\nProfessor of Surgery 
 with tenure\nProfessor of Psychiatry and Behavioral Sciences \nDepartment
  of Surgery\nDuke University Medical Center\n\nThis talk will be recorded
  and made available for on-demand viewing. Please visit our website linke
 d below for access.\n\nThe mission of Surgery Grand Rounds is to provide 
 an educational format that has a broad appeal to Duke faculty\, residents
 \, staff\, and students. Grand Rounds consists of a broad range of topics
  that are presented by local\, regional\, and international speakers on c
 linical education\, research science\, and developments in technology\, a
 nd also addresses other related issues that may affect our current and fu
 ture surgeons. Physicians who attend Surgery Grand Rounds are eligible to
  receive CME credit.\n\nFor more information\, please visit our website b
 y clicking on MORE EVENT INFORMATION below
DURATION:PT1H
