DESCRIPTION:Join Jason Gilmore\, Author\, CTO & Tech Founder \n\nStudents 
 will learn how to:\n• Build AI tools that can scale into businesses\, fas
 t\n• Turn ideas into proof of skill\n• Leave with an idea you can act on\
