 roducts with real paying users and will walk through how students can app
 ly similar approaches at an appropriate scale to strengthen your hiring e
 dge. \n\nJason holds the unusual distinction of never having created a pr
 ofessional resume\, having instead relied on continuous networking\, inte
 ntional outreach\, and proactive value creation to guide his career.
