DESCRIPTION:Using the M365 suite\, we'll walk through how an AI agent can 
 be created\, grounded in organizational files and knowledge sources\, and
  extended with tools such as email\, databases\, and Power Automate. Alon
 g the way\, we'll discuss when lightweight\, out-of-the-box chat features
  are sufficient and when it makes sense to move toward richer\, more tail
 ored experiences using Copilot Studio.
DURATION:PT2H
