CREATED:20260316T173247Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The South Asia Working Group invites you for an interactive
  book-talk with Professor Durba Mitra\, on March 18 at 4pm at Rubenstein 
 Hall 242. Professor Mitra\, the Richard B. Wolf Associate Professor of Wo
 men\, Gender\, and Sexuality at Harvard University\, will be discussing h
 er newest book -  The Future That Was: A History of Third World Feminism 
 Against Authoritarianism (Princeton UP\, 2026)\, and the ways in which So
 uth Asian feminist movements have contributed to an imaginary of a Third 
 World Feminism. Join us for an enriching conversation\, followed by refre
 shments.</p>\n<p><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScbbP4
 9lRwya007NqHF9B2G3O3H4D-0PIrcx9VtsA-x-ui52Q/viewform?usp=header">Register
  here!</a></p>
DURATION:PT1H30M
